    MaNTA_Decorator sharding, or every hook needs the new decorator)
  - the Python drivers: StellaratorState.py, desc-optimize-bfgs.py, scan_eq.py,
    scan_eq_ambipolar.py, yancc_gpu_test.py
  - why the branch removed both `#pragma omp parallel for` from
    TransportSystem.hpp's batched defaults -- ask eatocco; may be a real finding
    about OpenMP against a Python trampoline
